WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.700
Narrator: Same match, same check-in time, two marshals.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:10.600
Narrator: Noura is there early, in a clean uniform, with her accreditation round her neck.

3
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:15.200
Narrator: She signs in, collects her radio and tests it.

4
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:23.400
Narrator: Majed arrives forty minutes late, his tabard is in his bag, and his accreditation is at home.

5
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:28.300
Narrator: Without it, he cannot get in.

6
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:37.900
Narrator: So his post at Gate 4 - the one two thousand fans will walk through - starts the day empty.

